If you want to contribute to Renjin, then you will have to start by getting the build process working. Please refer to the instructions here: https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/BUILDING.md

Regarding the error with the date formatting: there is an issue in GitHub that may help you get started, it is #109 <https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/109>.

Good luck!

Maarten-Jan

